      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Chambers of Puissance [zone=1362]\n**Who:**\n- Scout Leader Sylen [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 110\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of The Chambers of Puissance (15 Points) [quest=13048]\n- The Body of the Beast [quest=13007]\n**Era:** | !The Outer Brood\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Oct 21 02:40:21 2024\nModified: Tue Dec 3 04:06:28 2024 | | You can obtain this task from Scout Leader Sylen not far from the zone in from The Harbinger's Cradle at /way -332, 264, -202. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Scout Leader Sylen'\nScout Leader Sylen looks Gebb up and down appraisingly. '[Adventurer] reinforcements?'\nYou say, 'I'm an adventurer.'\nScout Leader Sylen says, 'Vasha and renn, then. We could use your help. One of our scouts has gone missing and we don't believe he ever reported his findings to our group further in. Would you mind [searching] for us?'\nYou say, 'I don't mind searching.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Gastronauts'.\nScout Leader Sylen says, 'While we are deep in the heart of the beast - quite literally - I want to start our search close by, and work our way around the perimeter, checking the large workspaces. I can't risk any more losses. Please, scout about and let me know what you find.'\n\n---\n\nWith the intent of Norrathians to discover more about the internals of the great leviathan, and the machinations of the Chambers of Puissance, Scout Leader Sylen had sent out scouts, and one particular one never made it to the hand-off location further into the belly of the beast. Sylen seeks any information you can find.\nWhile searching, ensure that any offending scalewrought are dispatched. You do not need to be stealthy, the important element is finding the missing scout.\nSeek out the northeastern room, among their magical observational tools.\n1\\. Take down several scalewrought during your search 0/15 The Chambers of Puissance\na scalewrought artificer\na scalewrought striker\na scalewrought observer\na scalewrought worker\na scalewrought skyterror\n2\\. Explore the northeast room 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nThis is a location based update at /way -460, -9, -193\n3\\. Explore the southeast room 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nThis is a location based update at /way -1128, 29, -198\n4\\. Explore the southwest room 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nThis updates at /way -869, 740, -179\n5\\. Explore the northwest room 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nThis updates at /way -514, 743, -176\n6\\. Explore the hall north of the western rooms 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nThis updates at /way -348, 825, -176\n7\\. Check the scout for signs of life 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nScout Trais is at /way -309, 825, -179 in the far northwest corner of the zone.\nYou say, 'Hail, Scout Trais'\nYou have been given: Trais' Scouting Report\nYour task 'Gastronauts' has been updated.\nScout Trais is unresponsive. The young man appears to be gone, run through by the claws of one of the scalewrought. Searching further, the slightly open pack shows hints of paper within. Even if the scout could never make his way back to report his findings, perhaps you could bring back what he could not.\n8\\. Check in with Scout Leader Sylen 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nYou say, 'Hail, Scout Leader Sylen'\nYour task 'Gastronauts' has been updated.\nScout Leader Sylen says, 'Trais... the poor kid. He didn't deserve this fate. You're going to want to take that report over to Taruun Guardian Drenesh. She'll know what to do with it.'\n9\\. Give the Scouting Report to Taruun Guardian Drenesh 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nTaruun Guardian Drenesh is located on the bottom floor of the zone at /way -380, 655, -682. He's also on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou offered 1 Trais' Scouting Report to Taruun Guardian Drenesh.\nYour task 'Gastronauts' has been updated.\nThe report from Scout Trais was able to make it to Taruun Guardian Drenesh after all, but it looks like they may be down a scout. There may be more for you to do yet.\nTaruun Guardian Drenesh says, 'Wait... where's Trais? Damn it! Let me take a look at that.' She scans swiftly through the report obtained from the fallen scout, bearing her teeth as she runs down the findings the young man was able to find. In finality, she simply starts without follow up, 'Well.'\nYou complete the trade with Taruun Guardian Drenesh.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n267 platinum 1 gold 2 silver\nExperience\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
