. Spirits guide him. After that, we have a [plan].'\nYou say, 'What's the plan?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Body of the Beast'.\n\n---\n\nWith being down one scout Taruun Guardian Drenesh, in charge of this pocket of scouts deep within the Chambers of Puissance, has requested your assistance in studying the biological nature of the great leviathan you stand within. Private Vesk Is their local expert on biology, and will be the contact for this assignment.\nCheck in with Pnvate Vesk for more information regarding the request.\n1\\. Check in with Private Vesk to see what's needed of you 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nYou say, 'Hail, Private Vesk'\nPrivate Vesk says, 'Vasha, friend. You were referred from Drenesh here, huh? I'll do my best to get you on the same page, then.' The monk offers a friendly smile. 'I'm no priest, but I do honor the physical bodies we hone for battle and self-betterment, and those of ally and enemy alike. I like to think I'm learned. That said, this grand leviathan, it's hard to imagine how a being with such a large body and heart can survive with that biology. I think we're overdue to [study] the internal mechanisms.'\nYou say, 'I'll be happy to help with the study.'\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nPrivate Vesk says, 'That's what I want to hear. We're shorthanded with the loss of our friend Trais, so I'll need you to gather various materials from the body of the beast. Let's see... we'll need some blood samples from different veins, and any tissue samples you can find. Also, if you can find any of their tools that they use to work on these biological components.'\nPrivate Vesk says, 'Vasha, friend. You were referred from Drenesh here, huh? I'll do my best to get you on the same page, then.' The monk offers a friendly smile. 'I'm no priest, but I do honor the physical bodies we hone for battle and self-betterment, and those of ally and enemy alike. I like to think I'm learned. That said, this grand leviathan, it's hard to imagine how a being with such a large body and heart can survive with that biology. I think we're overdue to [study] the internal mechanisms.'\n2\\. Gather a blood sample from the veins at the southern end of the freshly-worked room 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nThis is a location update and it will put Leviathan Blood Sample on your cursor. /way -752, 169, -444\n3\\. Gather a blood sample from the veins just west of the blood pool 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nThis is another location update and it will also put Leviathan Blood Sample on your cursor. /way -715, 1253, -620\n4\\. Gather a blood sample from the veins north of the heart 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nAnother location update and the same item on the cursor at /way -482, 198, -749\n5\\. Gather several Leviathan Tissue Samples from various polyps 0/10 The Chambers of Puissance\nKill or /open a polyp or a large polyp, they can found in different parts of the zone. They are very low level. They drop Leviathan Tissue Sample. They respawn within a few minutes and are at static locations.\na polyp drops 1 Leviathan Tissue Sample.\na large polyp drops 2 Leviathan Tissue Samples.\n6\\. Find a few tools from the scalewrought workers 0/3 The Chambers of Puissance\nscalewrought workers drop Aureate Spanner.\n7\\. Kill several scalewrought workers 0/8 The Chambers of Puissance\nKill scalewrought workers to update this step.\n8\\. Return three Leviathan Blood Samples to Private Vesk 0/3 The Chambers of Puissance\nYou offered 1 Leviathan Blood Sample to Private Vesk.\nYou offered 1 Leviathan Blood Sample to Private Vesk.\nYou offered 1 Leviathan Blood Sample to Private Vesk.\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nPrivate Vesk says, 'Ah, excellent sample! Thank you!'\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nPrivate Vesk says, 'Ah, excellent sample! Thank you!'\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nPrivate Vesk says, 'Ah, excellent sample! Thank you!'\nYou complete the trade with Private Vesk.\n9\\. Return ten Leviathan Tissue Samples to Private Vesk 0/10 The Chambers of Puissance\nYou offered 10 Leviathan Tissue Sample to Private Vesk.\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nPrivate Vesk says, 'These are perfect tissue samples. Thanks!'\nYou complete the trade with Private Vesk.\n10\\. Return three Aureate Spanners to Private Vesk 0/3 The Chambers of Puissance\nYou offered 3 Aureate Spanner to Private Vesk.\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nPrivate Vesk says, 'Oooh! These are interesting spanners. I'll look these over.'\nYou complete the trade with Private Vesk.\n11\\. Speak with Private Vesk about your finds 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nYou say, 'Hail, Private Vesk'\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nPrivate Vesk says, 'You have brought me some excellent sources to study, Gebb. I'm going to need a moment, so please go speak with Taruun Guardian Drenesh and let her know I'm all set.'\n12\\. Report back with Taruun Guardian Drenesh 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nYou say, 'Hail, Taruun Guardian Drenesh'\nYour task 'The Body of the Beast' has been updated.\nWith the samples under investigation by Private Vesk, there may be more to come shortly. Check with Vesk to see what they recommend.\nYou receive 2 silver\nYou receive 1 gold\nYou receive 267 platinum\nYou have gained 1 mercenary ability point(s)