      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Chambers of Puissance [zone=1362]\n**Who:**\n- Private Vesk [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 110\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Modified Aureate Spanner [item=151044]\n- Tagged Aureate Spanner [item=151043]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of The Chambers of Puissance (15 Points) [quest=13048]\n- The Body of the Beast [quest=13007]\n**Era:** | !The Outer Brood\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Oct 26 04:24:11 2024\nModified: Thu Feb 13 12:08:52 2025 | | **Prerequisite Task:** The Body of the Beast [quest=13007]\n\n---\n\nThis task starts with Private Vesk [npc=60073] in The Chambers of Puissance at /way -422, 669, -681. He is located on the Find tool (Ctrl+F).\nYou say, 'Hail, Private Vesk'\nPrivate Vesk says, 'Oh hello, \\_\\_\\_\\_! I want to thank you for your samples. We're already learning some [interesting things] about this great beast, if you'd like to hear about it.'\nYou say, 'What interesting things did you find?'\nPrivate Vesk says, 'I'm glad you asked, \\_\\_\\_\\_! So, the tissue samples were our first clue that something was amiss. The areas that were less 'worked' by the Aureate scalewrought were of greater structural integrity. The [blood] was also of interesting and inconsistent quality.'\nYou say, 'What did you find with the blood?'\nPrivate Vesk says, 'Honestly, I sent that over to Thedran over there to look through into deeper detail. You'll have to give us some time on that. With that in mind, are you [interested] in doing more for us?'\nYou say, 'I'm interested. What would you like for me to do?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Wrench in their Plans'.\nPrivate Vesk says, 'Perfect. While Thedran continues to look into the blood, I think you could reach out to Adalaide.' The monk's head nudges in the half-elf's direction. 'She's fairly comfortable with their tools at this point, and might have some recommendations.'\n\n---\n\nPrivate Vesk Is working on analyzing the samples they were provided, and has asked you for some help with getting some additional information on the spanners that the Aureate use.\nVesk has indicated that Adalaide Galender has been looking over the spanners and may have some information regarding them.\n1\\. Speak with Adalaide Galenrider about the tools returned earlier 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nAdalaide Galenrider is in the same room with Private Vesk at /way -427, 688, -682. She is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Adalaide Galerider'\nAdalaide Galerider says, 'Mmmm, I'm [busy] right now.'\nYou say, 'You're busy with the spanners?'\nAdalaide Galerider says, 'Oh wait, you're \\_\\_\\_\\_, the one who brought them back, aren't you?' She sheepishly smiles. 'Well, sorry about that then. Did you know these tools aren't [mechanical] in nature? Thank Tunare, because I would hate to have to try to get an expert in tinkering down here.'\nYou say, 'They aren't mechanical?'\nYou have been given: Tagged Aureate Spanner\nYour task 'A Wrench in their Plans' has been updated.\nAdalaide Galerider says, 'Correct! These interface with magic, directly into the creature's parts. The same magic that our allies in the floors above have been attempting to study. As a result, we're going to request that you bring one of the spanners up to Researcher Rosinda within the Aureate Covert and get her feedback.' Digging into the box behind them, Vesk pulls one of the tools out, labelled with a small tag, and offers it over towards \\_\\_\\_\\_. 'This one would be perfect. See what she recommends.'\n2\\. Take the Tagged Aureate Spanner to Researcher Rosinda Wrannstad 0/1 Aureate Covert\nResearcher Rosinda Wrannstad is at the zone in of Aureate Covert, coming from The Theater of Eternity.\nYou offered 1 Tagged Aureate Spanner to Researcher Rosinda Wrannstad.\nYou have been given: Modified Aureate Spanner\nYour task 'A Wrench in their Plans' has been updated.\nResearcher Rosinda Wrannstad says, 'Fascinating... This tool is from Drenesh and Vesk?' She looks over the mechanisms of the spanner, finding the patterns matching much of the magic of the invading forces that she's seen thus far. With a slow shake of her head, she gives the most minor tweaks to it with a twitch of her hand. 'I do not want to think of what can be done with this, but I do want to ensure it cannot be done again.' The tool is offered back to \\_\\_\\_\\_, and she adds, 'I hope I have made the proper adjustments to short-circuit their interfaces. I still understand so little of their magic, but by subjecting it to a touch of Norrathian magic, its lack of comptatibility with their magical machinery may lead to problematic outcomes. I have a [request], however.'\nYou complete the trade with Researcher Rosinda Wrannstad.\n3\\. Update Private Vesk about the Modified Aureate Spanner 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nYou say, 'Hail, Private Vesk'\nPrivate Vesk says, 'Wait, she made adjustments to the tool? Is it [safe]?'\nSebb is enveloped in an enchanter's aura.\nYou say, 'She believes it to be safe, but if it hurts the leviathan, we are to cease its use.'\nYour task 'A Wrench in their Plans' has been updated.\nPrivate Vesk says, 'An honorable approach. Since you still have it, please do the honors. You know her wishes.' Passing over a roughly sketched diagram, Vesk points out the details of a small building formation with a central magical device along a \"hallway\". 'From information we obtained from Trais, some of these buildings have outer rooms flanking it, particularly on the top level of the Chambers. We believe there may be some of these rooms on the heart level, as well. Try interfacing the spanner with the central magical devices on whichever of these devices you find, and we'll see how it behaves. Good luck, \\_\\_\\_\\_.'\n4\\. Use the Modified Aureate Spanner on a top level magical device 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nThis was on the very top floor at /way -565, 489, -171\nYou right click the Modified Aureate Spanner next to the magical device. It will knock your invis off, so be prepared if there are mobs in the room on this step and the next. You might want to clear the room out first.\nYou begin casting Perform \"Maintenance\".\nThe compromised magic starts to arc from the spanner.\nAfter a slight delay, the device interfaces with the magical machine, and the machine swiftly slows to a halt.\nYour task 'A Wrench in their Plans' has been updated.\n5\\. Use the Modified Aureate Spanner on a top level magical device 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\n/way -902, 494, -174 not far from the first to the south on the same floor.\nYou right click the Modified Aureate Spanner next to the magical device. It will knock your invis off so be prepared if there are mobs in the room.\nYou begin casting Perform \"Maintenance\".\nThe compromised magic starts to arc from the spanner.\nAfter a slight delay, the device interfaces with the magical machine, and the machine swiftly slows to a halt.\nYour task 'A Wrench in their Plans' has been updated.\n6\\. Use the Modified Aureate Spanner on a heart level magical device 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\n/way -656, 576, -733 on the floor where the giant heart is in the middle. Same thing, you will need to clear out the room.\nYou begin casting Perform \"Maintenance\".\nThe compromised magic starts to arc from the spanner.\nAfter a slight delay, the device interfaces with the magical machine, and the machine swiftly slows to a halt.\nYour task 'A Wrench in their Plans' has been updated.\n7\\. Use the Modified Aureate Spanner on a heart level magical device 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\n/way -477, 389, -732 on the same floor not far from the step above, clear the room out.\nYou begin casting Perform \"Maintenance\".\nThe compromised magic starts to arc from the spanner.\nAfter a slight delay, the device interfaces with the magical machine, and the machine swiftly slows to a halt.\nYour task 'A Wrench in their Plans' has been updated.\n8\\. Kill several scalewrought manipulators 0/6 The Chambers of Puissance\nJust as it says, kill scalewrought manipulators. They usually surround the magical devices. If you have been clearing out the rooms, you have probably killed these anyways.\n9\\. Return the Modified Aureate Spanner to Private Vesk 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nYou offered 1 Modified Aureate Spanner to Private Vesk.\nYour task 'A Wrench in their Plans' has been updated.\nPrivate Vesk says, 'You did something and they are scrambling, but if Thedran's findings are to be believed, it's only a temporary measure. Go speak with him. You'll want to hear it from the source.'\nYou complete the trade with Private Vesk.\n10\\. Inquire with Thedran Narrok about the present status of the blood 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nTheran Narrok is right across the room from Private Vesk.\nYou say, 'Hail, Thedran Narrok'\nThedran Narrok says, 'Hrm... You heard, eh? The blood samples you returned had some troubling findings. The samples from the locations closer to the blood pool and heart had troubling levels of some venom, or poison... some unknown material that seems to be weakening the blood. I'm checking to see if purification spells or potions may be able to counteract it, but if something is affecting their blood, anything we try is only going to [slow them down], not stop them.'\nYou say, 'I can slow them down in the meantime.'\nYour task 'A Wrench in their Plans' has been updated.\nThedran Narrok says, 'That's what we want to hear. Go see what havoc you can bring upon our invaders, get them occupied, while I test what we can do on this blood. Vesk will verify your progress.'\n11\\. Kill several scalewrought forces to help slow them down 0/10 The Chambers of Puissance\nKill anything with scalewrought in their name.\n12\\. Check in with Private Vesk 0/1 The Chambers of Puissance\nYou say, 'Hail, Private Vesk'\nYour task 'A Wrench in their Plans' has been updated.\nThe scalewrought are confirmed to be doing something to the large leviathan. Master Alchemist Penigan has some theories from here.\nYou receive 2 silver .\nYou receive 1 gold .\nYou receive 267 platinum .\nYou have gained 19 ability point(s)!\nYou gain experience!\nPrivate Vesk says, 'You bought us some great time, \\_\\_\\_\\_. Thank you.' They smile warmly. 'Well, we sent our findings to Master Alchemist Penigan, and it seems not to contradict her theories. You've done what you could for us here, but perhaps she might have something for you and some fellow adventurers to get to the bottom of this. Good luck out there.'\n\n---\n\n267 platinum 1 gold 2 silver\nExperience\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
    },
