      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Chambers of Puissance [zone=1362]\n**Who:**\n- Master Alchemist Penigan [ _Raid and Mission_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 125\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n**Era:** | !The Outer Brood\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Sep 20 06:52:26 2025\nModified: Sat Sep 20 06:55:02 2025 | | You can obtain this group mission from Master Alchemist Penigan [npc=60072] in The Chambers of Puissance at /way -350,+230,-203.40 just outside the tunnel from The Harbinger's Cradle. She is on the Find tool (Ctrl+F).\nYou say, 'Hail, Master Alchemist Penigan'\nMaster Alchemist Penigan says, 'Hail, friend. You must be here to help deal with these monsters. You look like your skills involve killing stuff. Certainly helpful. My task is to figure out what is going on here. Somehow these dragon-things control the leviathan from here, or at least partially from here. If you get a chance, you can actually see the great beast's heart, exposed to the air. Who even thinks to do something like that? I have my [thoughts] about why they've done that, but I certainly can't even guess how they did it.'\nYou say, 'thoughts'\nMaster Alchemist Penigan says, 'I think they inject the heart with various chemicals to induce specific reactions. I also think that the nerve clusters leading away from the heart are being manipulated someplace else. I am excited to get a chance to look more closely at what they are up to in there, but I guess first someone like you will have to clear out the dangerous ones. I can show you the way to the heart if you are [willing] to give clearing them out a try.'\nYou say, 'willing'\nMaster Alchemist Penigan says, 'That's good to hear. Makes me feel a little safer knowing that someone will take the fight to them. I can assist you getting where you need to go. I just need to know if you have a [large] or a [smaller] group going with you.'",
